    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b93l",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s93k",
          "text": "Not every visitor to a property may make a premises liability claim. In Colorado, only two types of visitors have a claim for injuries against negligent property owners or managers. These are invitees and licensees.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b93o",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s93m",
          "text": "Invitees are generally retail customers.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s93n",
          "text": " The owner of a premises needs to maintain a reasonably safe property for invitees.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b93r",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s93p",
          "text": "Licensees are often social guests or enter a property with the owner’s permission.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s93q",
          "text": " Owners owe licensees a duty to protect or notify them of dangerous conditions that the owner knows of or should know of.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b93t",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s93s",
          "text": "A third type of visitor, trespassers, have no permission or authorization to enter a premises. Therefore, trespassers have little or no recourse for their injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b93v",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s93u",
          "text": "Parties in Premises Liability Claims",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b93x",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s93w",
          "text": "Premises liability accidents and injuries can happen anywhere; there are dangerous property conditions or potential risks. At-fault parties or entities may include business or residential property owners or even the government.",
          "marks": []
        }
